{"3885030": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Ashen Vow", "steam_appid": 3885030, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/f0c636a896971939d746283500d27864.poster.avif?t=1780617832\" width=780 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/f0c636a896971939d746283500d27864.webm?t=1780617832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/f0c636a896971939d746283500d27864.mp4?t=1780617832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The world of<i><strong> Ashen Vow</strong></i> evokes the <strong>dark, haunting atmosphere of Christian Medieval Europe.</strong> You play as a knight watch guard who <strong>uncovers an evil that was never meant to be found.</strong> The priests within this castle no longer follow the teachings you learned as a child. Has God truly led these holy men astray, or has a <strong>far darker force infiltrated the faith</strong> of those who devoted their lives to it? <strong>Combo enemies, learn their patterns, and survive.</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/0a5d968586090e9d6046800338fad961.avif?t=1780617832\" width=1280 height=280 /></span>The only way you're going to survive and kill The Black Maw is by mastering the art of your sword. Your weapon and your wits are the only thing that's going to help you here. Not just learn, but master the inputs for your attacks and create devastating and powerful combos. Opt into wide and quick swing routes to mow down crowds of enemies, or use your powerful single target combos to obliterate thicker skinned combatant and bosses.                   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/10f663778b39e002f417106293fb8a9f.poster.avif?t=1780617832\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/10f663778b39e002f417106293fb8a9f.webm?t=1780617832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/10f663778b39e002f417106293fb8a9f.mp4?t=1780617832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/3dd90252f0a135f1c7c0e576ac1fc92e.avif?t=1780617832\" width=1280 height=280 /></span>Every enemy is equipped with their own arsenal of tricky and deadly attacks. They fight for The Black Maw, and have taken their new oath to kill anything the Maw commands. Some come in numbers, some are a threat of their own. But to take down any of them you will need to learn and adapt to their move list and patterns. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/17f11be7e48527c2fe108b06a07231f0.avif?t=1780617832\" width=1280 height=280 /></span>  When you succumb to the horrors of The Black Maw, your job is still not done. In order to get back to the human realm, you must find the exit portal back. While journeys are quick and straightforward, the mysteries of this barren and sorrowful land can be explored, where you can find Lost Souls to collect, and maybe some others who are much less fortunate than yourself. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/13719842e9fc8fac88d9c3e601633ae0.poster.avif?t=1780617832\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/13719842e9fc8fac88d9c3e601633ae0.webm?t=1780617832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/13719842e9fc8fac88d9c3e601633ae0.mp4?t=1780617832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>My goal with <i>Ashen Vow</i> is to blend gritty medieval combat with psychological horror. While the combo system isn’t strictly historical, it’s designed to give players creative freedom in how they fight. I’ve focused on making the world and sound design as unsettling as I could, while also grounding the horror in the tension and desperation of each combat encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any thoughts on the game’s story, gameplay, or design, feel free to share them in the forums, on social media, or by contacting me directly. Thanks for the support, and hope you give my game a try!</p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/f0c636a896971939d746283500d27864.poster.avif?t=1780617832\" width=780 height=216 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/f0c636a896971939d746283500d27864.webm?t=1780617832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/f0c636a896971939d746283500d27864.mp4?t=1780617832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>The world of<i><strong> Ashen Vow</strong></i> evokes the <strong>dark, haunting atmosphere of Christian Medieval Europe.</strong> You play as a knight watch guard who <strong>uncovers an evil that was never meant to be found.</strong> The priests within this castle no longer follow the teachings you learned as a child. Has God truly led these holy men astray, or has a <strong>far darker force infiltrated the faith</strong> of those who devoted their lives to it? <strong>Combo enemies, learn their patterns, and survive.</strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/0a5d968586090e9d6046800338fad961.avif?t=1780617832\" width=1280 height=280 /></span>The only way you're going to survive and kill The Black Maw is by mastering the art of your sword. Your weapon and your wits are the only thing that's going to help you here. Not just learn, but master the inputs for your attacks and create devastating and powerful combos. Opt into wide and quick swing routes to mow down crowds of enemies, or use your powerful single target combos to obliterate thicker skinned combatant and bosses.                   <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/10f663778b39e002f417106293fb8a9f.poster.avif?t=1780617832\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/10f663778b39e002f417106293fb8a9f.webm?t=1780617832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/10f663778b39e002f417106293fb8a9f.mp4?t=1780617832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/3dd90252f0a135f1c7c0e576ac1fc92e.avif?t=1780617832\" width=1280 height=280 /></span>Every enemy is equipped with their own arsenal of tricky and deadly attacks. They fight for The Black Maw, and have taken their new oath to kill anything the Maw commands. Some come in numbers, some are a threat of their own. But to take down any of them you will need to learn and adapt to their move list and patterns. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/17f11be7e48527c2fe108b06a07231f0.avif?t=1780617832\" width=1280 height=280 /></span>  When you succumb to the horrors of The Black Maw, your job is still not done. In order to get back to the human realm, you must find the exit portal back. While journeys are quick and straightforward, the mysteries of this barren and sorrowful land can be explored, where you can find Lost Souls to collect, and maybe some others who are much less fortunate than yourself. <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/13719842e9fc8fac88d9c3e601633ae0.poster.avif?t=1780617832\" width=800 height=448 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/13719842e9fc8fac88d9c3e601633ae0.webm?t=1780617832\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/extras/13719842e9fc8fac88d9c3e601633ae0.mp4?t=1780617832\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>My goal with <i>Ashen Vow</i> is to blend gritty medieval combat with psychological horror. While the combo system isn’t strictly historical, it’s designed to give players creative freedom in how they fight. I’ve focused on making the world and sound design as unsettling as I could, while also grounding the horror in the tension and desperation of each combat encounter.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >If you have any thoughts on the game’s story, gameplay, or design, feel free to share them in the forums, on social media, or by contacting me directly. Thanks for the support, and hope you give my game a try!</p>", "short_description": "You are a knight sworn to God’s word, wielding only a sword against the darkness. But not all believers walk in good faith. The Black Maw has sunk its claws into the misguided, twisting their devotion into madness. Explore a once familiar castle now warped by evil, and cut down the corrupted horde", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/d36570da284aadca7c22a42270942a78bbd59881/header.jpg?t=1780617832", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/f899aee90e3b20b3bb42e76b529fcf61c6a6d2ec/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1780617832", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3885030/f899aee90e3b20b3bb42e76b529fcf61c6a6d2ec/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1780617832", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-2500K or AMD Ryzen 3 1200<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 960 or AMD Radeon R9 280<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-10600K or AMD Ryzen 5 5600X<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce RTX 2060 Super or AMD Radeon RX 5700 XT<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 800 MB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["KamenDev"], "publishers": ["KamenDev"], "demos": [{"appid": 4083610, "description": ""}], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "